BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Learn Guitar with Meghan
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261219T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261219T153000
UID:6aecdc3b30b4d5b2f42beb85@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have fun learning a new instrument - the guitar! This workshop
  will cover fundamentals of guitar playing: the parts of a guitar\, tuning
 \, strumming patterns\, and some basic chords. By the end of this class\, 
 you'll have learned the skills you need to start playing your first songs 
 on the guitar. Beginner friendly\, no previous experience is necessary.\nD
 rop-in\; no registration required. Capped at 12 participants per session. 
 12 guitars available for use. First come first served. Adults only.
LOCATION:York Woods\, Located in Basement - Arts Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aecdc3b30b4d5b2f42beb85
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
