DESCRIPTION:Learn to play Dungeons and Dragons at the Merril Collection of
  Science Fiction\, Speculation and Fantasy! Team up with a group of advent
 urers to explore unknown lands\, meet allies\, and battle foes. Maybe\, yo
 u'll even be a hero.\nOver the course of this three hour session\, you wil
