 a screening of The Secret Agent (2025)\nBrazil\, 1977. Marcelo\, a technol
 ogy expert in his early 40s\, is on the run. Hoping to reunite with his so
 n\, he travels to Recife during Carnival but soon realizes that the city i
 s not the safe haven he was expecting. Winner of Best Director and Best Ac
 tor in Cannes.\nFilm rating: R\nLength 161 minutes
