BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mahjong Game Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261216T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261216T183000
UID:6b04709504009d00338a9544@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exciting evening of Mahjong\, the classic tile-
 based game that combines strategy\, skill\, and a bit of luck! Whether you
 're a beginner looking to learn the basics or an experienced player wantin
 g to enjoy friendly competition\, this program offers a welcoming space to
  connect with others and have fun. Learn the rules\, practice your strateg
 y\, and discover why Mahjong has been enjoyed around the world for generat
 ions. All skill levels are welcome. Tiles and instruction will be provided
 . Come play\, socialize\, and experience the excitement of Mahjong!
LOCATION:Northern District\, Room 200
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6b04709504009d00338a9544
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
