BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Branch Art Exhibit: Works by Animative Space\, Back To The Essence
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261101T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261130T235959
UID:6ae89bf09d27a00045550e59@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Throughout the month of November\, the works by Animative Spac
 e are on display at Albion Branch.\nAnimative Space is a Toronto based mu
 ltimedia art studio where our mantra is\, “We create stylized art”. Ou
 r chosen art form allows us to blend both\nphysical and digital products\;
  paintings\, designer toys\, stickers\, murals and nfts into vibrant style
 s of art that pushes the boundaries of creativity.\n"The inspiration for o
 ur work comes from artists of the past as to build a future you must know 
 your past. Other art avenues that play a huge inspiration\nin what we crea
 te are anime\, street art\, graffiti."\nThe exhibit can be viewed during A
 lbion branch's open hours. Please check the\nAlbion branch\npage before yo
 u visit.\nFree. All are welcome.\nPhoto credit: Animativespace\,\nStephan 
 Spencer\, Essence of Peace\, Pencil\, Medium
LOCATION:Albion
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ae89bf09d27a00045550e59
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
