DESCRIPTION:Are you feeling stuck in your job search? Explore the incredib
 le resources and expertise offered by ACCES Employment. Connect with an Em
 ployment Consultant to get tailored resume reviews\, invaluable interview 
 tips\, and a wealth of additional support. Have a free 30-minute appointme
 nt and embark on a remarkable journey toward your dream job\, like 3-3:30 
 pm\, or 3:30-4 pm.\nPlease bring your finished resume/cover letter to the 
 session & your specific questions during the consultation\, for example e
 diting your resume\, job search\, volunteer opportunities\, or Interview 
 preparation etc.\nPlease cancel as soon as possible if you no longer need 
 the session before the program starts. (\nKind reminder:\nPlease register 
 for or join the waitlist for only one session per day.)\nSpace is limited.
  Help is available on a first-come\, first serve basis.\nPlease arrive a f
 ew minutes early.\nIf no slots are available on your desired consultation 
 date\, contact ACCES Employment directly for an appointment at\n416-443-90
 08\n(North York Location) /\n416-921-1800\n(Downtown Location). Or visit\n
 accesemployment.ca\nThe personal information on this form is collected by 
 the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)
 \, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and prog
 ram registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the librar
