BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Finding Recovery Through Exercise Skills and Hope (FRESH)- Fridays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270108T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270108T183000
UID:6b072ad26d2424003a020d01@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This\n program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn
  new skills\, and \nhave fun. It involves peer-led group activities which 
 can include crafts\, games\,\n walking\, yoga\, and more. Meet new folks\
 , build social connections\, and tell us\n about programs and services you
  would like to see in the neighbourhood!\nThe program will run once a week
 \, every Friday\, 4:30-6:30\nDrop in program\, no registration required.\n
 Snacks and refreshments are provided for all participants. Ingredient list
 s will be available at the program.\nThis program is in collaboration wit
 h\nGerstein Crisis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, 1st floor\, Browsery
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6b072ad26d2424003a020d01
